This project is a .NET port of the SoccerNet Game State Reconstruction baseline. It is
derived from, and builds on, the following third-party open-source works.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
sn-gamestate
  Upstream:  https://github.com/SoccerNet/sn-gamestate
  License:   GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)
  Used for:  the football modules ported into src/PitchWise.GameState
             (detection wiring, team clustering, jersey OCR, calibration,
             reid, visualization, dataset loading, GS-HOTA evaluation).

TrackLab
  Upstream:  https://github.com/TrackingLaboratory/tracklab
  License:   MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022 bstandaert
  Used for:  the tracking-framework core ported into src/PitchWise.Tracking
             (pipeline/module abstractions, DataFrame datastruct, offline
             tracking engine, coordinate/attribute-voting utilities, HOTA core).

TrackEval (HOTA)
  The HOTA metric core follows the reference implementation from
  https://github.com/JonathonLuiten/TrackEval (MIT License).
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

