without distributing the software to users, is "mere interaction over a network" and does
not by itself require you to release the source of a separate service that uses it. (This
is the practical difference between GPL-3.0 and AGPL-3.0; PitchWise uses GPL-3.0.) This
paragraph is a plain-language summary, not legal advice — the LICENSE text governs.

